4. Corresponding source (GPL-2.0 section 3, LGPL-2.1 section 6)
----------------------------------------------------------------
For every released firmware binary the complete corresponding source is this repository at the release's git tag,
together with its submodule freeink-sdk at the commit pinned by that tag. It builds with PlatformIO
(`pio run -e diptyx`; see diptyx/README.md, "Building from source", and platformio.ini for the exact library pins).
Every flashed build is also tagged (flashed-*). This is a written offer: the same source stays available, at no
charge beyond the cost of copying, from https://github.com/casualducko/crosspoint-diptyx and
https://github.com/casualducko/freeink-sdk for at least three years after each release, to anyone who has a binary.

